Third-party licenses and attributions for hermes-jarvis-voice
==============================================================

The UI renders with the first-party Hermes UI library (vendored in
hermes-plugin/dashboard/dist/hui by ~/ai/repos/hermes-ui/bin/hui-sync). The
intelligence-core renderer (ui/src/visualizer/core.js) is first-party code
ported from this project's own design prototype. Earlier builds shipped
three.js, Tailwind utilities and orb code from jincocodev/openclaw-jarvis-ui;
none of that remains in the source tree or the shipped bundle.

1. Vendored code
----------------
service/jarvisd/audio/_whisper_features.py — numpy-only Whisper log-mel
feature extraction, vendored verbatim (header trimmed) from pipecat
(src/pipecat/audio/turn/smart_turn/_whisper_features.py), itself mirroring
the math of transformers' WhisperFeatureExtractor (Apache-2.0).

